integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int", 32)
class:
    patterns:
        pair
    members:
        x as integer
        y as integer
class:
    patterns:
        bounds
    members:
        low as pair
        high as pair
a [pair] with x horizontal and y vertical means: @intrinsic("construct", pair, horizontal, vertical)
instance's field means: @intrinsic("property", instance, field)
function set variable to value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("store", variable, value)
flex section while condition:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("loop while", condition)
function visit {arguments:items}:
    replacement:
        set {index} to 0
        while @intrinsic("less than", index, @intrinsic("type extent", items, 0)):
            set {item} to @intrinsic("extract element", items, index)
            @intrinsic("discard", item)
            set index to @intrinsic("add", index, 1)
set box to @intrinsic("construct", bounds, (a pair with x 1 and y 2), (a pair with x 3 and y 4))
visit box's low, (a pair with x box's high's x and y box's low's y), box's high and (a pair with x box's low's x and y box's high's y)
